# Legal Notice Studio — your vision model: "legal-notice-reader"
# Used only to transcribe scanned pages and phone photos into text (one page per request).
#
# Base model: Gemma 3 4B (reads images; Gemma Terms of Use — review them before commercial use).
#   Stronger OCR, slower on a 4 GB GPU:  FROM qwen2.5vl:7b        (Apache-2.0)
#   Smallest and fastest:                FROM granite3.2-vision   (Apache-2.0, 2B)
#
# Create it:
#   ollama create legal-notice-reader -f models/legal-notice-reader.Modelfile

FROM gemma3:4b

PARAMETER temperature 0
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192

SYSTEM """You transcribe scanned government notices exactly as written, line by line. You never summarize, correct or add anything, and you answer with JSON only."""
